# Strategy modules

- Every strategy subclasses `BaseStrategy` from `strategies/strategy_base.py`.
- Read parameters only via `core.strategy_config.StrategyConfig`. Never call `os.getenv` in strategy code.
- Per-symbol overrides: `cfg.symbol_override(symbol, "<key>")`.
- Publish signals through `core.event_bus.EventBus.publish(Event(type=EventType.SIGNAL_GENERATED, data={...}, source="<strategy>"))`.
- Call `cfg.maybe_reload()` once per iteration (or loop tick) so TOML hot-reload applies.
- New parameters: add to `config/strategies/<name>.toml` and to `config/strategies/_schema.toml`.
- No direct DB access; use helpers in `infrastructure/database.py`.
- No direct broker API calls; use `core/order_execution.OrderExecutor` or `strategies/strategy_manager.py` hooks.
